# Images are opt-in: retain these statistical plots, exclude dataset examples.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
!/results/stage1_wrapup/fig*.png
!/results/stage2_uncertainty/stage2b_analysis/fig*.png
!/results/stage2_uncertainty/paired_normal_vs_adverse/stage2c_analysis/fig*.png
